  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING CHANGE: a back-dated Metadata.From (inception date) is now used as sent to pick the option, rate configuration and rate table versions, instead of being replaced by today.\n      Affects GetOffers, GetOffersCorporateV1, GetOffersCorporate, RepriceOffers, RepriceOffersCorporate and PolicyRenewal.\n      Review your callers before upgrading: send the real inception date (MM/dd/yyyy or ISO), never a placeholder date; leave From empty to use today.\n      There is no back-dating limit in the rating engine: check your own limit before the call.",
